{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reach the top</h2>I wanna reach the top is a tower climbing platformer game. Start from the bottom, the goal is to reach the top of the tower, by launching/jumping yourself up one step after another in a ragdoll pose.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plan your jumps</h2>The tower is composed by a lot of different buildings and platforms, you'll have to plan your own route to the top of the tower.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NPCs</h2>And you'll meet different weirdos alone your journey, with wired conservations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fall</h2>You will probably fall a lot during the process of trying to get to the next taller spot. Plan your route to the top, the next move, be patience, don't let it get to you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ragdoll</h2>Your character will have no animation, ragdoll the way up to the top of the tower. And it's just hilarious to watch your character struggling.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1937460?t=1672447679","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1937460?t=1672447679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1672447679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1672447679","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Check out this!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reach the top</h2>I wanna reach the top is a tower climbing platformer game. Start from the bottom, the goal is to reach the top of the tower, by launching/jumping yourself up one step after another in a ragdoll pose.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plan your jumps</h2>The tower is composed by a lot of different buildings and platforms, you'll have to plan your own route to the top of the 